C2 (net2 VSS) capacitor c=1p
C3 (V_out net3) capacitor c=1p
Q1 (X net0 net2 VSS) sky130_fd_pr__npn_05v5_W1p00L1p00
Q2 (VCC X net3 VSS) sky130_fd_pr__npn_05v5_W1p00L1p00
R200 (net3 VSS) resistor r=200
R50 (V_out VSS) resistor r=50
R600 (VCC X) resistor r=600
RE1 (net2 VSS) resistor r=1k
RFB (X net0) resistor r=2k
RIN (net0 net1) resistor r=2k
